Actually, the message was "Your leather armor rots!" even though
I was wearing crystal plate.  A brown pudding kept touching me
and rotting the armor (surely this can't be right).  

The fix is to change the material type for crystal plate mail
in objects.c from 0 to (METAL | 1).  Yeah, I know crystal plate 
is not a metal, but surely it is not supposed to rot like leather.

And this is as of patch1;  I haven't seen patch2 yet to know if
this has been fixed.


